    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p>Human Design Engine provides educational and reflective Human Design calculations, reports, and guide experiences. It is not medical, legal, financial, or psychological advice.</p>
    <p>Users are responsible for providing accurate birth information. Reports are generated from the submitted data and available calculation engine.</p>
    <p>Contact team@humandesignengine.com for support questions.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>.legal-page{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:96px 24px;color:#2F3631}.legal-page h1{font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:3rem}.legal-page p{line-height:1.8;color:#5C625E}</style>
